# Taris, the swoop race (K1, tar_m03ae the Bek base, tar_m03af the swoop
# platform): the accelerator to Gadon, the races, Brejik's betrayal and
# the fight, Bastila freed, back to the Upper City's apartment. Starts from
# the Vulkar base's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough k1 @vulkar_out data/routes/k1/taris_swoop.route --god
#
# The races are played (tar_m03mg, the swoop minigame, `race`): the race's
# own script sets the time and takes the party back to the pits.
exit tar03_bekdoor       # the Lower City into the Bek base
say i have the accelerator right here
use GadonThek112         # the accelerator handed over; the race is on
talk
save race_eve
module tar_m03af         # Gadon's mechanic sends the party to the platform
save swoop_pits
use RaceAnnoun031        # the first race
talk
race                     # tar_m03mg, back to the pits at its end
to tar03_postrace
talk
save race1
use RaceAnnoun031        # the second: a better time wins it
talk
race                     # tar_m03mg, back to the pits at its end
to tar03_postrace
talk                     # the mechanic
if Tar_SwoopStatus=0     # lost (the bot's time not good enough): again,
use RaceAnnoun031        # as a player would
talk
race
to tar03_postrace
talk
end
talk                     # the announcer, Brejik, Bastila
fight 20
save brejik_dead
to 219,222               # by the cage: Bastila comes to the player, and from beside
                         # the race desk (Desk2) her walk to Brejik's body after
                         # began wedged in it
use Bastilla03           # Bastila, freed
talk
module tar_m02af         # the apartment
save bastila
